{"step_index":1299,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:18:07Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-20T02:48:07+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-20T02:48:08+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/neurax_app/README.md`\nTotal Lines: 186\nTotal Bytes: 9796\nShowing lines 1 to 186\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # NEURAX 3.0 — Visual Inspection & Defect Root-Cause Assistant\n2: \n3: > **NEURAX HACKATHON 3.0 · Domain 2 — AI in Industry & Automation**\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 🎯 Problem Understanding\n8: \n9: High-throughput manufacturing environments face compounding losses from three interlocking problems that generic tools treat in isolation:\n10: \n11: | Problem | Consequence |\n12: |---|---|\n13: | Subtle defects missed at production speed | Escapes → warranty claims, recalls |\n14: | Bottlenecks undetected in multi-station flow | Lost throughput, idle WIP, overtime cost |\n15: | No connection between quality and process conditions | Root causes never addressed; defects recur |\n16: \n17: NEURAX 3.0 is a **unified industrial decision-support system** that solves all three simultaneously — without requiring live hardware, PLC connections or robotic integration.\n18: \n19: ---\n20: \n21: ## 🏗️ Architecture\n22: \n23: ```\n24: ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n25: │                       NEURAX 3.0 System                         │\n26: │                                                                 │\n27: │  ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐  │\n28: │  │  Image Input  │    │ Production CSVs  │    │  Economic    │  │\n29: │  │  (JPG/PNG)   │    \n<truncated 7070 bytes>\npper, uncertainty handling\n145: │   ├── defect_registry.py          ← Session-scoped per-unit results store\n146: │   ├── production_analyzer.py      ← TOC bottleneck + WIP + throughput KPIs\n147: │   ├── root_cause.py               ← Rule-based correlation + drift analysis\n148: │   └── profitability.py            ← Financial model + what-if simulator\n149: ├── utils/\n150: │   ├── constants.py                ← Classes, thresholds, correlation rules\n151: │   └── chart_helpers.py            ← Plotly chart factory (all visualisations)\n152: └── README.md\n153: ```\n154: \n155: ---\n156: \n157: ## 🏆 Judging Criteria Coverage\n158: \n159: | Criterion | How Addressed |\n160: |---|---|\n161: | Defect detection accuracy | YOLOv8 with 5 trained classes, confidence thresholds |\n162: | Defect localisation | Bounding boxes in detection mode; class scores in classification |\n163: | Robustness to unseen conditions | UNCERTAIN + NOVEL flags instead of forced misclassification |\n164: | False-reject / false-accept | Adjustable confidence threshold slider |\n165: | Root-cause correlation | Rule engine with HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW evidence cards |\n166: | Explainability | Each card shows Evidence → Cause → Action chain |\n167: | Technical implementation | Modular, all pure Python, reproducible |\n168: | UI/UX & Visualisation | 4-tab Streamlit, Plotly charts, colour-coded status |\n169: \n170: ---\n171: \n172: ## 🛠️ Tech Stack\n173: \n174: | Component | Technology |\n175: |---|---|\n176: | AI / Vision | Ultralytics YOLOv8 |\n177: | UI | Streamlit 1.35+ |\n178: | Visualisation | Plotly Express + Graph Objects |\n179: | Data Processing | pandas, numpy |\n180: | Image Processing | PIL (Pillow), OpenCV (via ultralytics) |\n181: | Production Analysis | Custom TOC engine (pure Python) |\n182: \n183: ---\n184: \n185: *NEURAX 3.0 — All analyses are advisory/simulated. No live hardware access required or used.*\n186: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":1300,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:18:17Z","thinking":"The `README.md` requires revision to remove all emojis and ensure the project name is \"Autonomous Quality & Process Intelligence Platform,\" not \"NEURAX 3.0.\" The tab descriptions necessitate updating to accurately reflect their functionality: \"Quality Inspection\" (YOLOv8 & Grad-CAM), \"Production Flow Health\" (Real-Time Conveyor Physics & TOC), \"Root Cause Analysis\" (Dynamic Multi-Tier Causal Correlation), and \"Profitability &\".\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Executive README without emojis and with accurate 5-tier architecture.\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"# Autonomous Quality & Process Intelligence Platform\\n\\n> Executive-Grade Cyber-Physical Decision Support System for High-Throughput Manufacturing\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Problem Understanding\\n\\nHigh-throughput industrial manufacturing environments face compounding economic losses from three critical challenges that conventional tools treat in silos:\\n\\n| Operational Challenge | Direct Industrial Consequence |\\n|---|---|\\n| Subtle micro-defects undetected at production line speed | Defect escapes, customer warranty claims, expensive field recalls |\\n| Dynamic bottlenecks and queue accumulation across multi-stage lines | Starvation, idle work-in-progress (WIP), missed delivery schedules |\\n| Disconnect between defect manifestation and upstream process physics | Recurring quality failure modes without systemic remediation |\\n\\nThis platform delivers a **unified cyber-physical AI intelligence suite** that integrates real-time computer vision, Theory of Constraints (TOC) production telemetry, dynamic causal root-cause reasoning, 3D economic optimization landscapes, and neural network surrogate digital twins.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## End-to-End System Architecture\\n\\n```\\n+---------------